+<body><main><h1>CommerceLint private report checkout</h1>
+<p id="mode">Checking service mode…</p>
+<p>Public HTML screening for field presence, parseability and discoverability. No JavaScript rendering, store login or guarantee of platform compliance. Reports download privately here; this service does not send email.</p>
+<form id="intake"><p><label>One-time plan <select name="plan_id"><option value="sample">Sample — $1.99 — 1 page</option><option value="lite">Lite — $9.99 — up to 5 pages</option><option value="comprehensive">Comprehensive — $19.99 — up to 15 pages</option></select></label></p>
