+<button type="submit">Prepare secure checkout</button></form>
+<p id="status" role="status"></p><p><a id="pay" hidden target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Continue to Stripe in a new tab</a></p>
+<p><button id="save" hidden>Save private access file</button> <button id="report" hidden>Check for my report</button></p>
+<p>The private access file grants access to your report for 30 days from checkout preparation. Keep it private. Return here after payment; payment confirmation and report generation may take time.</p>
+<p><label>Reopen a saved private access file <input id="restore" type="file" accept="application/json,.json"></label></p>
+<p><a href="mailto:pchordia@unsubscriber.me">Contact CommerceLint support</a>. Include your order reference, never your private access token or card details.</p>
